book rust_nfc_parameters v1
description "Two parameters written differently that Rust and Python take for one: lot_K, and lot_K with the Kelvin sign, which NFC makes K"

unit pcs

account stock(sku: string) : pcs
  at least 0 refused as out_of_stock
account suppliers : pcs outside
account customers : pcs outside

transfer receive(delivery: string, lot_K: string, lot_K: string, sku: string, qty: pcs)
  key delivery, lot_K, lot_K
  move qty from suppliers to stock(sku)

transfer ship(order: string, sku: string, qty: pcs)
  key order, sku
  move qty from stock(sku) to customers
